    <string name="settings_opt_a_title">Option A — Built-in Wireless Debugging Bridge (No PC)</string>
    <string name="settings_opt_a_steps">1. Tap Start Pairing &amp; Open Developer Options below.\n2. Enable Wireless Debugging, then tap Pair device with pairing code.\n3. Keep that dialog open! Pull down the notification shade and enter the 6-digit code in Routine\'s notification.</string>
    <string name="settings_opt_a_offline_notice">You have the strict zero-INTERNET Offline APK installed. Android requires INTERNET permission for local 127.0.0.1 Wireless Debugging &amp; mDNS discovery — install Routine-v0.1.0-alpha-wirelessAdb.apk for on-device Option A pairing, or use Option B (One-Time ADB Grant) above.</string>
